{"title": "The Whispering Promise", "pageid": 3431, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/The_Whispering_Promise", "categories": ["Rings", "Uncommon items", "Healing set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-uncommon\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ring_F_1_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Ring_F_1_Faded.png/300px-Ring_F_1_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/a/aa/Ring_F_1_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"The Whispering Promise image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Ring_F_1_Faded.png/300px-Ring_F_1_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/Ring_F_1_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">The Whispering Promise</span></a> is an uncommon <a href=\"/wiki/Rings\" title=\"Rings\">Ring</a> that grants a bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a> to creatures healed by the wearer.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A soft, soothing voice floats from this ring, reciting a prayer over and over.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rings\" title=\"Rings\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/25px-Rings_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/38px-Rings_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/50px-Rings_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rings\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/25px-Rings_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rings\" title=\"Rings\">Rings</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Uncommon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Uncommon</span></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/38px-Journal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/50px-Journal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Journal Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_Items_consumable_by_Gale\" title=\"List of Items consumable by Gale\">Consumable</a> by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/38px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/50px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gale\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\">Gale</a></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 40 gp / 85 gpHHonour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  40  gp /  85  gp<abbr title=\"Honour mode only\" class=\"bg3wiki-damage-rider-source nomobile\">H</abbr><sup class=\"mobileonly\">Honour</sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_MassHealRing</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_MassHealRing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_MassHealRing\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">4aef9bb0-38a8-428e-8b87-6e462d612dd6</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:4aef9bb0-38a8-428e-8b87-6e462d612dd6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:4aef9bb0-38a8-428e-8b87-6e462d612dd6\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_MassHealRing</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_MassHealRing+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_MassHealRing+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Blessed_Mercy\" title=\"Blessed Mercy\">Blessed Mercy</a></dt><dd>When you heal a creature, it gains a <span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/46px-D4_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/62px-D4_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"31\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/D4_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> <b>+1d4</b> bonus to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack roll\">Attack rolls</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving throw\">Saving throws</a> for 2 turns.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Goblin_Camp\" title=\"Goblin Camp\">Goblin Camp</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-99&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;424</span>: Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grat\" title=\"Grat\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Portrait_Grat.png/25px-Portrait_Grat.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Portrait_Grat.png/38px-Portrait_Grat.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Portrait_Grat.png/50px-Portrait_Grat.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Grat the Trader\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Portrait_Grat.png/25px-Portrait_Grat.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f7/Portrait_Grat.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Grat\" title=\"Grat\">Grat the Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Sacred_Pool\" title=\"Sacred Pool\">Sacred Pool</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;260&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;510</span>: Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Volo\" title=\"Volo\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Portrait_Volo.png/25px-Portrait_Volo.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Portrait_Volo.png/38px-Portrait_Volo.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Portrait_Volo.png/50px-Portrait_Volo.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Volo\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Portrait_Volo.png/25px-Portrait_Volo.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4c/Portrait_Volo.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Volo\" title=\"Volo\">Volo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Camp\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Camp\">Camp</a>: Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Volo\" title=\"Volo\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Portrait_Volo.png/25px-Portrait_Volo.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Portrait_Volo.png/38px-Portrait_Volo.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Portrait_Volo.png/50px-Portrait_Volo.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Volo\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Portrait_Volo.png/25px-Portrait_Volo.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4c/Portrait_Volo.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Volo\" title=\"Volo\">Volo</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Volo does not trade via dialogue at the Sacred Pool. One must click the trade button in the lower left while speaking with him to do so. The ring can also be stolen.</li>\n<li>This ring can only be bought or stolen from Grat if it was not previously acquired from Volo. It is the same ring, confiscated from Volo when he is captured.</li>\n<li>If Volo is rescued and joins the party's camp, he sells the ring there if it was not previously acquired from him or Grat. Additionally, Grat no longer sells the ring after Volo leaves the Goblin Camp, even if Volo later dies or leaves the party's camp.</li></ul>\n\n<p><i>Regarding Blessed Mercy:</i></p>\n<ul><li>Applies the same condition as the standard <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bless\" title=\"Bless\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/20px-Bless_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/30px-Bless_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/40px-Bless_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bless\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/20px-Bless_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bless\" title=\"Bless\">Bless</a> spell, and therefore cannot stack with it.\n<ul><li>Despite also being called <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bless\" title=\"Bless\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/20px-Bless_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/30px-Bless_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/40px-Bless_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bless\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/20px-Bless_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bless\" title=\"Bless\">Bless</a>, this buff is not enhanced by the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Staff_of_Arcane_Blessing\" title=\"Staff of Arcane Blessing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/91/Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Staff_of_Arcane_Blessing\" title=\"Staff of Arcane Blessing\">Staff of Arcane Blessing</a>.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Multi-target healing abilities, such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mass_Healing_Word\" title=\"Mass Healing Word\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Mass_Healing_Word_Icon.webp/20px-Mass_Healing_Word_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f8/Mass_Healing_Word_Icon.webp/30px-Mass_Healing_Word_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f8/Mass_Healing_Word_Icon.webp/40px-Mass_Healing_Word_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mass Healing Word\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Mass_Healing_Word_Icon.webp/20px-Mass_Healing_Word_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f8/Mass_Healing_Word_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mass_Healing_Word\" title=\"Mass Healing Word\">Mass Healing Word</a> or a thrown <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Healing\" title=\"Potion of Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Healing\" title=\"Potion of Healing\">Potion of Healing</a>, bless all affected creatures (potentially including the caster).</li>\n<li>Drinking a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Healing\" title=\"Potion of Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Healing\" title=\"Potion of Healing\">Potion of Healing</a> counts as healing oneself and triggers the effect of the ring as well.</li>\n<li>The Bless effect is applied even if the target being healed is already at full health.</li>\n<li>Healing effects from the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Regeneration\" title=\"Ring of Regeneration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Ring_of_Regeneration_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_of_Regeneration_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Ring_of_Regeneration_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_of_Regeneration_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Ring_of_Regeneration_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Ring_of_Regeneration_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Ring_of_Regeneration_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_of_Regeneration_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e2/Ring_of_Regeneration_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Regeneration\" title=\"Ring of Regeneration\">Ring of Regeneration</a>, <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helm_of_Balduran\" title=\"Helm of Balduran\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Helm_of_Balduran\" title=\"Helm of Balduran\">Helm of Balduran</a>, or taking a <a href=\"/wiki/Short_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short Rest\">Short Rest</a> all count as healing oneself and trigger the effect of the ring as well.</li>\n<li>The self-healing from <a href=\"/wiki/Life_Domain\" title=\"Life Domain\">Life Domain</a> Cleric's <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blessed_Healer\" title=\"Blessed Healer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Generic_Healing_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Healing_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Generic_Healing_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Healing_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Generic_Healing_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Healing_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blessed Healer\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Generic_Healing_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Healing_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Generic_Healing_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blessed_Healer\" title=\"Blessed Healer\">Blessed Healer</a> does not trigger the effect.</li>\n<li>Gaining <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_hit_points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary hit points\">temporary hit points</a> does not count as healing and therefore does not trigger the effect.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_Links\">External Links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Whispering_Promise\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Whispering Promise\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Whispering_Promise\">Whispering Promise</a></span> on the <